WEBVTT

00:00:00.884 --> 00:00:06.390
Oh, I'm so busy. Season Fairies have
so much work. There's no time to rest.

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:09.393
Humans are lucky
to get days off.

00:00:09.393 --> 00:00:12.262
Then I guess you
can't play today, huh?

00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:13.897
Even though it's a holiday...

00:00:13.897 --> 00:00:14.998
Oh, it is?

00:00:14.998 --> 00:00:17.100
That's too bad.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.103
No, it's ok. After all,
I'm still in training.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:21.671
That's not something
to be proud of.

00:00:21.671 --> 00:00:23.298
Yeah, you're right.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:27.043
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:27.043 --> 00:00:30.147
Kuchibiru ni

00:00:30.147 --> 00:00:34.641
Namida no rouge...

00:00:54.604 --> 00:00:58.208
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:58.208 --> 00:01:05.546
Ai nante, shiritaku naiwa.

00:01:09.119 --> 00:01:12.722
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:12.722 --> 00:01:15.559
Kuchibiru ni

00:01:15.559 --> 00:01:19.120
Namida no rouge...

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:26.903
Mokuyou ni

00:01:26.903 --> 00:01:30.073
Bara o kai,

00:01:30.073 --> 00:01:34.203
Tegami o soete.

00:01:37.781 --> 00:01:41.651
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:41.651 --> 00:01:44.454
Yume de au.

00:01:44.454 --> 00:01:49.357
Anata wa yasashii...

00:01:54.231 --> 00:01:55.630
Wait! Wait!

00:02:01.371 --> 00:02:05.364
Little bird! Bath, bath!

00:02:24.194 --> 00:02:25.395
A little more to the right.

00:02:25.395 --> 00:02:26.384
What?

00:02:34.371 --> 00:02:36.271
What's that?

00:02:46.149 --> 00:02:47.651
-Mmm, they smell good.

00:02:47.651 --> 00:02:49.352
-Mmm, they smell good.
-Saga! Saga!

00:02:49.352 --> 00:02:50.751
Oh, no! Oh, no!

00:02:53.356 --> 00:02:57.360
Hey! Out in the plaza they were all
bang-bang and making noise.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.563
The town was filled with people!

00:02:59.563 --> 00:03:02.623
There were pretty
decorations everywhere.

00:03:02.899 --> 00:03:06.236
-What is it? What is it?
-Why? Huh? Tell me.
-What's happening?

00:03:06.236 --> 00:03:10.297
All right, all right. Have one
of these and calm down.

00:03:12.576 --> 00:03:14.373
-Yummy!
-Yummy!
-Yummy!

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:18.014
-They're good, aren't they?

00:03:18.014 --> 00:03:19.215
-They're good, aren't they?
-Yeah!

00:03:19.215 --> 00:03:23.618
But I'm using these for tomorrow's festival,
so you can't have anymore.

00:03:24.054 --> 00:03:25.180
Festival?

00:03:25.889 --> 00:03:31.094
It's called the Muhlenburg Festival.
That's why it's so busy outside.

00:03:31.094 --> 00:03:32.729
Muhlenburg Festival?

00:03:32.729 --> 00:03:34.397
What's that?

00:03:34.397 --> 00:03:38.333
Hmm, I'll try to explain it simply.

00:03:39.102 --> 00:03:46.142
A long time ago some children made
homemade cookies for their sick mother.

00:03:46.142 --> 00:03:51.341
They say after eating the cookies, she
got better, and her illness was cured.

00:03:52.349 --> 00:03:56.353
Since then there's a festival every year,
and kids walk around giving cookies

00:03:56.353 --> 00:04:03.350
to everyone they know, saying
"Thank you for everything," and "Stay well."

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:05.996
What a wonderful story.

00:04:05.996 --> 00:04:09.366
Cool! Cookies are amazing!

00:04:09.366 --> 00:04:12.995
Cookies that make you
better, huh? I'd like to try them.

00:04:14.371 --> 00:04:16.362
Ok, let's have
some cookies! Huh?

00:04:18.108 --> 00:04:21.373
Hey! You'll have to make
do with what I gave you.

00:04:25.882 --> 00:04:29.152
I've never seen
a festival before!

00:04:29.152 --> 00:04:33.680
Are festivals fun?
Interesting? Huh, Saga?

00:04:34.658 --> 00:04:36.250
You'll see tomorrow.

00:04:58.615 --> 00:05:00.917
Cool! Cool!

00:05:00.917 --> 00:05:02.714
I've gotta tell Saga!

00:05:04.354 --> 00:05:05.355
Saga! Saga!

00:05:05.355 --> 00:05:07.050
Saga!

00:05:11.161 --> 00:05:15.120
Hey, hey, what's that? What's that?
Why are you wearing those clothes, Saga?

00:05:15.765 --> 00:05:17.867
Why, Saga, why?

00:05:17.867 --> 00:05:21.738
For festivals we wear
our traditional clothing.

00:05:21.738 --> 00:05:24.366
Wow. That sounds fun!

00:05:25.875 --> 00:05:27.010
-Ok, let's go!

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:27.844
-Ok, let's go!
-Yeah!

00:05:27.844 --> 00:05:28.833
Grandma!

00:05:29.379 --> 00:05:31.381
Oh, are you going out already?

00:05:31.381 --> 00:05:34.316
Yeah! I'm meeting up with
Norma and Anne.

00:05:34.551 --> 00:05:37.384
Oh, um...
Here.

00:05:37.721 --> 00:05:38.551
Oh.

00:05:39.155 --> 00:05:41.385
Thanks for everything, Grandma.

00:05:42.258 --> 00:05:43.623
Thanks!

00:05:43.727 --> 00:05:45.524
Thank you, Saga.

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:49.063
Ok, I'll be back in a while!

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:51.501
Have fun.

00:05:51.501 --> 00:05:52.502
I will!

00:05:52.502 --> 00:05:53.526
Waffo!

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:03.413
I knew Norma
wouldn't be on time.

00:06:03.413 --> 00:06:06.849
Yeah, she'll be her
usual five minutes late.

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:11.488
Saga, Saga.

00:06:11.488 --> 00:06:12.956
-Ow, ow, ow. What?

00:06:12.956 --> 00:06:14.446
-Ow, ow, ow. What?
-What's that?

00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:17.418
Oh, that's a balloon doll.

00:06:18.895 --> 00:06:22.732
Oh, you're right.
How clever. I'm impressed.

00:06:22.732 --> 00:06:23.466
And what's that?
Oh, you're right.
How clever. I'm impressed.

00:06:23.466 --> 00:06:23.900
And what's that?

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:27.131
Um, those are people
drinking and partying.

00:06:27.237 --> 00:06:28.438
Ah, looks fun!

00:06:28.438 --> 00:06:29.572
Ah, looks fun!
Huh? Well, it's a
festival after all.

00:06:29.572 --> 00:06:30.440
Huh? Well, it's a
festival after all.

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:31.429
Y-You're right...

00:06:32.175 --> 00:06:33.877
Hey, Saga...

00:06:33.877 --> 00:06:35.345
Sorry!

00:06:35.345 --> 00:06:37.347
Sorry I'm late.

00:06:37.347 --> 00:06:38.837
Like always.

00:06:39.382 --> 00:06:41.684
Ok, now that
we're all here...

00:06:41.684 --> 00:06:42.708
-Here.
-Here.

00:06:43.219 --> 00:06:45.779
Thanks for always being
such good friends!

00:06:46.556 --> 00:06:49.225
Let's continue
being good friends.

00:06:49.225 --> 00:06:51.250
Please don't give up on me!

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.061
These are sweet and yummy!

00:07:00.103 --> 00:07:04.407
Oh, my cookies might
be a little hard. Sorry.

00:07:04.407 --> 00:07:06.204
They are.

00:07:06.776 --> 00:07:08.073
Hey, Sugar.

00:07:08.411 --> 00:07:12.081
Hey, hey. They're doing
something interesting over there.

00:07:12.081 --> 00:07:14.184
Do you want to
hang out with us?

00:07:14.184 --> 00:07:16.209
Something interesting?

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:18.421
I won't go...

00:07:18.421 --> 00:07:19.422
-Huh?
-Huh?

00:07:19.422 --> 00:07:23.654
I've decided I'm going to spend
all day with Saga today.

00:07:23.827 --> 00:07:24.816
Wh-Why?

00:07:25.028 --> 00:07:27.897
Because we've been
apart for so long.

00:07:27.897 --> 00:07:31.424
Now we can finally
be together, and...

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.306
Yeah, you're right.
Let's hang out today.

00:07:36.306 --> 00:07:37.364
Yeah!

00:07:40.276 --> 00:07:43.546
It's all right. We can
have fun on our own.

00:07:43.546 --> 00:07:44.781
-Ok, see you later!

00:07:44.781 --> 00:07:45.941
-Ok, see you later!
-Yahoo!

00:07:48.151 --> 00:07:49.385
Saga? Let's go.

00:07:49.385 --> 00:07:50.374
Oh, yeah.

00:07:51.821 --> 00:07:53.857
Muhlenburg Festival...

00:07:53.857 --> 00:07:59.996
The more popular you are, the more
cookies you can exchange, right?

00:07:59.996 --> 00:08:04.592
This is my first festival since
coming to this town. I'm ready!

00:08:05.235 --> 00:08:06.402
Well then!

00:08:06.402 --> 00:08:10.236
Come on, everyone!
My cookies are here!

00:08:34.097 --> 00:08:37.367
Ginger, let's go to the
festival on a date!

00:08:37.367 --> 00:08:41.497
And... And accept this
token of my affection!

00:08:42.171 --> 00:08:45.375
Ok, let's meet back at
the usual place tonight!

00:08:45.375 --> 00:08:46.376
Ok!

00:08:46.376 --> 00:08:47.365
See you later.

00:08:49.379 --> 00:08:51.247
Ok, let's go, Sugar.

00:08:51.247 --> 00:08:54.384
Ok. But where
are we going?

00:08:54.384 --> 00:08:57.649
Don't worry. I have
it all planned out.

00:09:01.591 --> 00:09:02.717
-Mr. Luchino.
-Mr. Luchino.

00:09:04.227 --> 00:09:05.558
Oh, Saga.

00:09:05.929 --> 00:09:07.130
-Here you go!

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:08.119
-Here you go!
-Oh.

00:09:08.765 --> 00:09:10.130
Thanks for everything.

00:09:10.233 --> 00:09:13.168
Thank you. I hope you
continue to help me out.

00:09:13.403 --> 00:09:15.394
Sure.
Just leave it to me.

00:09:15.805 --> 00:09:16.973
Who's next?

00:09:16.973 --> 00:09:17.962
Let's see...

00:09:21.711 --> 00:09:23.713
Thank you for everything.

00:09:23.713 --> 00:09:26.181
No, thank you, Saga.

00:09:27.617 --> 00:09:28.584
Who's next?

00:09:28.584 --> 00:09:29.983
Over here, over here!

00:09:32.455 --> 00:09:34.424
Oh, am I too late?

00:09:34.424 --> 00:09:37.060
It looks like Mr. Henry
went to the festival.

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:38.628
He's not here?

00:09:38.628 --> 00:09:40.563
No, we'll have
to search for him.

00:09:40.563 --> 00:09:43.054
Ok, I'll help you search!

00:09:43.232 --> 00:09:45.223
Ok? Leave it to me!

00:09:52.241 --> 00:09:54.232
Oh, dear, what have I done?

00:09:59.382 --> 00:10:00.383
Huh?

00:10:00.383 --> 00:10:01.873
Saga, over here!
Over here!

00:10:07.623 --> 00:10:09.955
Saga, what's that?

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:13.220
What?
Is Mr. Henry here?

00:10:19.035 --> 00:10:20.024
What's this?

00:10:31.414 --> 00:10:32.711
Wh-What?

00:10:40.156 --> 00:10:41.885
Saga! Watch out!

00:11:11.054 --> 00:11:12.180
Sugar!

00:11:13.056 --> 00:11:14.648
Sugar!
Hang in there!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:19.962
Don't worry.
I'm not hurt, Saga.

00:11:19.962 --> 00:11:21.759
This box is all soft.

00:11:23.099 --> 00:11:25.727
Hey, Saga! It's me.

00:11:26.069 --> 00:11:28.404
That voice... Phil?

00:11:28.404 --> 00:11:29.803
You got it!

00:11:31.407 --> 00:11:35.778
How do you like it? Master Phil's Special
Box-Shaped Robot, Robotchi No. 1!

00:11:35.778 --> 00:11:39.348
I made it especially for
the Muhlenburg Festival!

00:11:39.348 --> 00:11:41.350
Don't make any
sudden moves, Phil!

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:43.352
Whew, that scared me.

00:11:43.352 --> 00:11:47.220
Its best point is the eyes, Saga!
Look at the eyes.

00:11:51.127 --> 00:11:52.361
What do you think?

00:11:52.361 --> 00:11:55.665
Ah, um...
I don't really know.

00:11:55.665 --> 00:11:59.368
Besides, what do you plan to
do with this Robo-whatever?

00:11:59.368 --> 00:12:01.237
Well, since it's the
festival and all,

00:12:01.237 --> 00:12:03.372
I figured I'd use this
to give out cookies!

00:12:03.372 --> 00:12:05.431
If the eyes light up,
I can even use it at night!

00:12:05.908 --> 00:12:09.901
Cool, cool!
Hey, Saga, isn't it cool?

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:13.683
I wonder if Saga's mad.

00:12:13.683 --> 00:12:15.878
No, I think she's shocked.

00:12:20.389 --> 00:12:21.378
Saga?

00:12:22.391 --> 00:12:25.758
Oh, Phil, this is
so typical of you.

00:12:27.396 --> 00:12:29.728
You think?
I knew you'd understand, Saga.

00:12:30.266 --> 00:12:32.768
Ok, I'll give you
some cookies.

00:12:32.768 --> 00:12:36.072
Um... Alan and Jan
are inside, right?

00:12:36.072 --> 00:12:37.273
-Here I am!
-Here I am!

00:12:37.273 --> 00:12:39.264
Ok, here's three.

00:12:42.912 --> 00:12:44.347
-What're you doing?
-What're you doing?

00:12:44.347 --> 00:12:46.349
Wh-What're you doing?

00:12:46.349 --> 00:12:48.317
I'll take them!

00:12:48.551 --> 00:12:51.076
We can almost reach it.

00:12:52.221 --> 00:12:54.189
Wait. If we do this...

00:12:56.359 --> 00:12:58.520
W-Wait. Wait!

00:13:07.203 --> 00:13:08.830
Phil! The brake! The brake!

00:13:29.892 --> 00:13:31.382
-Ow! Ow! Ow!
-Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:40.192
If we do some emergency repairs,
maybe it'll be ok.

00:13:41.804 --> 00:13:46.798
But don't overdo it and hurt yourselves.
It's the festival, after all.

00:13:48.344 --> 00:13:49.333
-Thank you!
-Thank you!
-Thank you!

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:52.704
Aren't they here yet?

00:13:53.349 --> 00:13:54.941
Say "cheese."

00:13:56.419 --> 00:13:59.081
Ok. Here is a token
of my affection.

00:14:05.194 --> 00:14:07.396
-Mr. Henry's not here.

00:14:07.396 --> 00:14:08.590
-Mr. Henry's not here.
-Yeah...

00:14:09.899 --> 00:14:11.890
That's a good one!

00:14:12.602 --> 00:14:13.336
-Mr. Henry!

00:14:13.336 --> 00:14:14.370
-Mr. Henry!
-Huh?

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.667
Oh, Saga.

00:14:15.972 --> 00:14:18.440
Here. This is for everything.

00:14:18.975 --> 00:14:21.170
Oh, thank you!

00:14:25.248 --> 00:14:27.239
I sure am popular.

00:14:27.583 --> 00:14:29.118
-What's with this girl?

00:14:29.118 --> 00:14:30.380
-What's with this girl?
-She's dressed weird.

00:14:30.853 --> 00:14:32.688
These aren't bad!

00:14:32.688 --> 00:14:35.020
I like them a little
sweeter, but still...

00:14:59.148 --> 00:15:00.349
They're doing it!

00:15:00.349 --> 00:15:02.752
Saga. There's a bunch
of people over there!

00:15:02.752 --> 00:15:04.743
Oh, yeah, that's...

00:15:24.373 --> 00:15:25.374
Waffo!

00:15:25.374 --> 00:15:27.069
Saga, let's dance!

00:15:27.376 --> 00:15:32.507
Huh? But I still have to give
Ms. Hannah and Greta their cookies.

00:15:32.848 --> 00:15:35.681
Just for a little bit!

00:15:36.018 --> 00:15:39.422
Oh, all right, but just
for a little bit, ok?

00:15:39.422 --> 00:15:40.411
Yay!

00:16:07.316 --> 00:16:08.305
I'm so tall!

00:16:13.689 --> 00:16:14.986
Ms. Hannah.

00:16:16.125 --> 00:16:19.424
Oh! Where's Ms. Hannah? Ow!

00:16:20.429 --> 00:16:23.599
Saga. Something smells good!
Where is it?

00:16:23.599 --> 00:16:26.432
Oh, Sugar.
This isn't the time for that.
Saga. Something smells good!
Where is it?

00:16:29.438 --> 00:16:31.372
It's no use, I guess.

00:16:32.441 --> 00:16:35.672
Wow! That looks yummy!
Right, Saga?

00:16:35.845 --> 00:16:37.039
Y-Yeah.

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:39.371
Excuse me.
I'd like one, please.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:42.351
Oh, Saga.

00:16:42.351 --> 00:16:43.552
Ms. Hannah!

00:16:43.552 --> 00:16:44.883
Lancelot!

00:16:45.054 --> 00:16:47.750
Hello! Ah, um...

00:16:48.524 --> 00:16:51.394
Here! Thank you for everything.

00:16:51.394 --> 00:16:53.828
Oh, my...
Thank you!

00:16:58.167 --> 00:17:02.399
That's strange.
No one's coming to take my cookies.

00:17:03.406 --> 00:17:06.075
I-I'll just wait a
little bit longer.

00:17:06.075 --> 00:17:08.839
The festival's just beginning.

00:17:14.417 --> 00:17:16.852
Everyone's having a good time.

00:17:16.852 --> 00:17:17.841
Yeah.

00:17:18.053 --> 00:17:20.385
Yeah, huh, Turmeric?

00:17:23.259 --> 00:17:25.461
Well, I've got work to do.

00:17:25.461 --> 00:17:27.430
Oh, I'll come with you!

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:31.196
I love watching
you work, Turmeric!

00:17:36.972 --> 00:17:38.963
Ginger!

00:17:40.109 --> 00:17:42.445
So that's where you've been.

00:17:42.445 --> 00:17:43.810
Elder...

00:17:44.079 --> 00:17:45.603
Um, ah...

00:17:47.583 --> 00:17:50.984
Please just take this,
no questions asked!

00:17:51.387 --> 00:17:54.379
Oh! Oh, no...

00:17:56.392 --> 00:17:59.520
Ah, um... It's the
thought that counts.

00:18:00.095 --> 00:18:01.892
See you later.

00:18:03.399 --> 00:18:08.393
G-Ginger accepted
my feelings!

00:18:10.406 --> 00:18:12.908
What should I do?
I still have cookies left!

00:18:12.908 --> 00:18:14.899
Did I waste too much time?

00:18:15.244 --> 00:18:17.346
Who are those cookies for?

00:18:17.346 --> 00:18:18.414
Greta.

00:18:18.414 --> 00:18:20.416
Then let's go
give them to her!

00:18:20.416 --> 00:18:24.153
But I don't know if
I'll find her in time.

00:18:24.153 --> 00:18:27.423
It's almost time to meet
up with Norma and Anne.

00:18:27.423 --> 00:18:29.653
I saw Greta a while ago.

00:18:30.092 --> 00:18:31.081
Really?

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:53.649
In the plaza?
She was here?

00:18:53.649 --> 00:18:56.752
Yeah. When you guys
all met here before.

00:18:56.752 --> 00:19:00.813
What? Then she's
probably not still here.

00:19:01.056 --> 00:19:02.990
Oh, there she is,
over there!

00:19:03.392 --> 00:19:05.383
She's in the same
place as before!

00:19:07.062 --> 00:19:08.051
Greta.

00:19:10.933 --> 00:19:12.662
-What happened?
-What happened?

00:19:13.702 --> 00:19:17.160
Oh, Miss Saga!
I'm so sick of wait...

00:19:18.307 --> 00:19:20.876
What a coincidence,
meeting you here!

00:19:20.876 --> 00:19:23.646
Y-yeah...
I'm glad I found you.

00:19:23.646 --> 00:19:26.282
Oh, did you need
me for something?

00:19:26.282 --> 00:19:27.271
Yeah.

00:19:27.416 --> 00:19:28.405
Here.

00:19:29.518 --> 00:19:30.507
Oh...

00:19:31.353 --> 00:19:33.923
You're giving cookies
to your rival?

00:19:33.923 --> 00:19:34.912
Yeah.

00:19:35.424 --> 00:19:40.362
Well, it would be bad manners to just
take them, so I'll give you some in return.

00:19:40.362 --> 00:19:42.264
Here's your cookies.

00:19:42.264 --> 00:19:43.253
Thanks!

00:19:44.366 --> 00:19:45.355
Oh, and...

00:19:46.569 --> 00:19:49.094
Have you been
here all this time?

00:19:49.271 --> 00:19:52.942
Of course not! Wh-What are you
talking about, Miss Saga?

00:19:52.942 --> 00:19:56.605
I just happened to pass by.

00:20:00.049 --> 00:20:01.380
See you later.

00:20:02.885 --> 00:20:06.655
That's good, Saga. Are you
finished giving out cookies now?

00:20:06.655 --> 00:20:11.388
Yeah. I made it somehow,
thanks to you, Sugar.

00:20:13.028 --> 00:20:15.656
Ok, let's head over
to the meeting place!

00:20:16.398 --> 00:20:18.400
Here? We've been here before.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:21.961
Yeah. I'm meeting
Norma and Anne here.

00:20:22.871 --> 00:20:24.440
I see.

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:28.399
So this is the end of just
me and Saga hanging out.

00:20:30.412 --> 00:20:32.004
And this...

00:20:32.548 --> 00:20:34.175
This is for you, Sugar.

00:20:38.354 --> 00:20:43.359
Thanks for everything, Sugar.
I was glad for all your help today, too.

00:20:43.359 --> 00:20:44.348
Saga...

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:49.361
Thanks, Saga!

00:20:52.101 --> 00:20:53.830
I love you!

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:18.827
Saga! Saga! What's that?
There are flowers in the sky.

00:21:18.827 --> 00:21:21.397
They're called fireworks.
Aren't they pretty?

00:21:21.397 --> 00:21:22.386
Yeah.

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:29.171
Hey! Hey! Festivals are fun, aren't they!
Is it because I was with you?

00:21:29.171 --> 00:21:31.799
Wh-What're you
talking about?

00:21:32.441 --> 00:21:35.069
But, you're right...

00:21:36.779 --> 00:21:41.978
I don't think I've had this much
fun at a festival in a long time.

00:21:48.357 --> 00:21:50.092
We're late again!

00:21:50.092 --> 00:21:51.821
The fireworks have
already started.

00:22:21.023 --> 00:22:25.494
Tsuki no negai

00:22:25.494 --> 00:22:28.964
Mizu ni tokete

00:22:28.964 --> 00:22:34.403
Shiroi namiki-michi mitsuketa

00:22:34.403 --> 00:22:39.308
Hoshi-kuzu no uta

00:22:39.308 --> 00:22:47.349
Nana-iro no hashi
o wataru kaze

00:22:47.349 --> 00:22:52.821
Shitte ita yo ne

00:22:52.821 --> 00:22:57.626
Kimochi tsunagu ureshisa

00:22:57.626 --> 00:22:59.928
Sugar Snow

00:22:59.928 --> 00:23:07.703
Kona-yuki mau machi ni yagate

00:23:07.703 --> 00:23:13.008
Kirei na hana
saku kisetsu ni

00:23:13.008 --> 00:23:17.001
Anata o omou

00:23:19.681 --> 00:23:24.286
Kokoro o tokasu

00:23:24.286 --> 00:23:28.357
Ai wa, yume wa

00:23:28.357 --> 00:23:34.387
Sono mune ni aruno

00:23:39.668 --> 00:23:40.736
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:40.736 --> 00:23:43.338
Preview of Next Episode
Waffo!
The festival was fun!

00:23:43.338 --> 00:23:47.342
I got to dance with Saga.
I got cookies, and I got to see fireworks.

00:23:47.342 --> 00:23:49.344
But you know
what was the best?

00:23:49.344 --> 00:23:50.345
What?

00:23:50.345 --> 00:23:56.218
Of course, it was Robotchi No. 1! I mean,
his eyes light up all bright! It was cool!

00:23:56.218 --> 00:23:57.913
I knew you'd say that.

00:23:58.353 --> 00:24:02.357
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The Next Episode Is
"One Memory for Two."

00:24:02.357 --> 00:24:06.384
Now, what should I give Saga
to thank her for the cookies?
